THIRD-PARTY ASSETS

assets/third-party/debian-openlogo-nd.svg
    The Debian Open Use Logo (swirl, without the "Debian" wordmark).
    Copyright (c) 1999 Software in the Public Interest, Inc.
    Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3 or any later
    version, or, at your option, the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
    Unported License.
    Source: https://www.debian.org/logos/

    NOT covered by the CC BY-SA 4.0 license above, and not a Strata asset.
    Used to state truthfully that Strata is built on Debian. Debian's trademark
    policy forbids using their logos as part of another project's own logo or
    branding, so it must never be incorporated into a Strata mark, only shown
    alongside text describing the project.
    Debian asks that the image link to https://www.debian.org/ where it is used
    on a web page.
